        ecrm:P3_has_note    "The design consists of shields and the lozenges bearing bees, and the coat-of-arms of the Barberini Family.  The shields are surmounted by a crown, and the whole is held together  by delicate forms.  Sewed to the lower ends are points.  Pieced."@en ;
